---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Education — Sovereign Stack Blueprint" description="The Sovereign Stack Blueprint course — eight modules from zero to sovereign.">
<!-- Education v2 | /onemind/education/ -->
<section class="hero-full" style="min-height:auto;padding:3rem 0 2rem;">
  <div class="hero-badge">LEARN</div>
  <h1 style="font-size:2.8rem;">The <span style="color:var(--accent-bright);">Sovereign Stack</span> Blueprint</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub" style="font-size:1.15rem;max-width:600px;">8-module cohort course. 4 weeks. Build a running sovereign operations center on your own hardware. Live build calls. Templates included. Graduate as an Operator.</p>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Course Modules</h2>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;">
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;"><h4>Module 0 — The Doctrine</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">What you're building and why. The four planes. The sovereignty case. The architecture decisions that shape everything.</p></div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;"><h4>Module 1 — The Foundation</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">The box. Docker. Tailscale mesh. First server. Backups. The physical layer that everything runs on.</p></div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;"><h4>Module 2 — The Bus</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">NATS. Subjects, leaf nodes, JetStream. First sensors on the bus. The nervous system comes online.</p></div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;"><h4>Module 3 — The Eyes</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">TAK Server + CloudTAK. Certificates. First users on the COP. A sovereign common operating picture.</p></div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;"><h4>Module 4 — The Senses</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Cameras (MediaMTX + Frigate). Environment sensors. ADS-B receiver. The stack starts perceiving the world.</p></div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;"><h4>Module 5 — The Memory</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">ClickHouse. History, replay, dashboards. Every byte stored. Every query possible.</p></div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;"><h4>Module 6 — The Mind</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">The AI agent on the fabric. Legacy deployment. Alerts, presence, automation, guardrails. The stack starts thinking.</p></div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;"><h4>Module 7 — The Field</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Drones and robotics. Geofences. Missions. Wearables. The stack reaches into the physical world.</p></div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;"><h4>Module 8 — Go Live</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">30-day hands-off trial. Monitoring, upkeep, expansion. You're the operator now.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1rem;">Course Details</h2>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:1rem;">
    <div><h4>⏱️ Duration</h4><p>4 weeks. 2 modules per week. 2 live build calls weekly + office hours.</p></div>
    <div><h4>💰 Price</h4><p>$797. 20 seats per cohort. Includes all templates + recordings forever + Operator community level.</p></div>
    <div><h4>🎯 Deliverable</h4><p>A running sovereign operations stack on your own hardware. Not a certificate. A working system.</p></div>
    <div><h4>🎓 Graduation</h4><p>Graduates become Operators — advanced community access, 1-on-1 channel, priority agent routing.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<div style="text-align:center;padding:2rem 0;">
  <a href="/resources/community/" class="btn-primary" style="display:inline-block;font-size:1rem;">Join Community for Cohort Dates →</a>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
